# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# The track title in slot 0 (a Home Assistant media_player automation writes
# it) crawling beside a bobbing note, over a sound field ramped to one
# palette. With no sensor feed the field plays its built-in demo groove.
S - Now Playing
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Field
I @pat/spectrum-field
R 80 0:000000 140:5a1a8c 230:ff7ad9 255:ffffff
L color 0 0 0 11 normal 70 none fill 1
N Band
L sprite 1 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Note
I @spr/music-note
L text 10 2 0 0 normal 100 black fill 1
N Title
T slot 0
F tiny ffffff l left 12
